{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Out Of Body is a block pushing puzzle game where death and possession are keys to the solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sacrifice yourself to turn into a ghost, possess skeletons and carve yourself a path to reach the goal with your original body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the realm of death and free lost souls from their torments. Each soul presents a unique puzzle to solve, will you be able to save them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048270/extras/9787cd34287c399c189cd7d5ec2fbc3b.poster.avif?t=1767871205\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048270/extras/9787cd34287c399c189cd7d5ec2fbc3b.webm?t=1767871205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048270/extras/9787cd34287c399c189cd7d5ec2fbc3b.mp4?t=1767871205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048270?t=1767871205","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048270?t=1767871205","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048270/013f09a575d267b5904cc5488b15cceb793ef775/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767871205","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048270/013f09a575d267b5904cc5488b15cceb793ef775/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767871205","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Out Of Body is a block pushing puzzle game where death and possession are keys to the solu